  "title": "Crispy Garlic Herb Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "Pan-roasted bone-in chicken thighs with crispy golden skin, rosemary, garlic cloves, and a rich pan-jus reduction.",
  "prepMinutes": 15,
  "cookMinutes": 25,
  "servings": 4,
  "recipeType": "Main Dish",
  "mealType": "Main Dish",
  "cuisine": "",
  "ingredients": [
    "4 Bone-in chicken thighs",
    "4 cloves Garlic, smashed",
    "2 sprigs Fresh rosemary",
    "1 tbsp Olive oil",
    "1/2 cup Chicken stock"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Pat chicken thighs completely dry and season with salt.",
    "Sear skin-side down over medium heat for 12 minutes until deeply crisp.",
    "Flip, add garlic and rosemary, and roast until internal temp reaches 165°F."
  ],
